        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    mean = 0.01\n    std_dev = 0.005\n    x = 0.005\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    import math\n\n    probability_density = (\n        1 / (math.sqrt(2 * math.pi) * std_dev)\n    ) * math.exp(-((x - mean) ** 2) / (2 * std_dev ** 2))\n\n    answer = round(probability_density, 6)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
